sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant API as API (FastAPI)
    participant SVC as OnboardingService
    participant OCR as AI/OCR (Gemini Flash)
    participant DB as MySQL (stored procedures)

    U->>FE: Enter email + choose ID image
    FE->>FE: Validate email, type (JPG/PNG), size (5 MB)
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/onboarding (multipart/form-data)
    API->>SVC: process(email, filename, bytes)
    SVC->>SVC: Validate email and image (magic bytes, size, resolution, blur)
    alt Invalid input
        SVC-->>API: AppError (415 / 413 / 422)
        API-->>FE: JSON {error: {code, message}}
        FE-->>U: Friendly error message
    else Valid image
        SVC->>OCR: Image + extraction prompt (JSON schema, temperature 0)
        OCR-->>SVC: name, document number, type, confidence, legibility
        SVC->>SVC: Normalize number, decide VERIFIED / NEEDS_REVIEW
        SVC->>DB: CALL sp_create_onboarding(...)
        DB-->>SVC: Stored record (id, UTC timestamp)
        SVC-->>API: OnboardingResponse
        API-->>FE: 201 Created + JSON
        FE-->>U: Extracted data, confidence and status
    end
